{"id":"genesis","links":[{"id":"q1","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"romans","c":1,"v":23},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":1,"v":26},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Romans speaks of exchanging God’s glory for “images of mortal man”; in Genesis, God says, “Let Us make man in Our image.”"},{"id":"q2","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"1-corinthians","c":11,"v":7},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":1,"v":26},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"1 Corinthians calls man “the image and glory of God”; in Genesis, God says, “Let Us make man in Our image.”"},{"id":"q3","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"1-corinthians","c":15,"v":49},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":1,"v":26},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"1 Corinthians speaks of bearing “the likeness of the earthly man”; in Genesis, God says, “Let Us make man in Our image, after Our likeness.”"},{"id":"q4","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"2-corinthians","c":3,"v":18},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":1,"v":26},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"2 Corinthians speaks of being “transformed into His image”; in Genesis, God says, “Let Us make man in Our image.”"},{"id":"q5","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"2-corinthians","c":4,"v":4},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":1,"v":26},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"2 Corinthians calls Christ “the image of God”; in Genesis, God says, “Let Us make man in Our image.”"},{"id":"q6","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"colossians","c":3,"v":10},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":1,"v":26},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Colossians speaks of a new self renewed “in the image of its Creator”; in Genesis, God says, “Let Us make man in Our image.”"},{"id":"q7","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":3,"v":9},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":1,"v":26},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"James says men “have been made in God’s likeness”; in Genesis, God speaks of making man “after Our likeness.”"},{"id":"q8","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"matthew","c":19,"v":4},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":1,"v":27},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Matthew has Jesus say the Creator “made them male and female”; Genesis says “male and female He created them.”"},{"id":"q9","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"mark","c":10,"v":6},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":1,"v":27},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Mark says that from the beginning God “made them male and female”; Genesis says “male and female He created them.”"},{"id":"q10","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"hebrews","c":4,"v":4},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":2,"v":2},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Hebrews repeats that on the seventh day “God rested from all His works”; Genesis tells how God finished and rested from “all His work.”"},{"id":"q11","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"hebrews","c":4,"v":10},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":2,"v":2},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Hebrews says whoever enters God’s rest rests from work, “just as God did”; Genesis says God rested on the seventh day."},{"id":"q12","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"1-corinthians","c":15,"v":45},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":2,"v":7},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"1 Corinthians repeats “became a living being” from Genesis, where the LORD God forms man from the dust and breathes life into him."},{"id":"q13","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"1-corinthians","c":15,"v":47},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":2,"v":7},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"1 Corinthians says the first man “was of the dust of the earth”; Genesis says God formed man “from the dust of the ground.”"},{"id":"q14","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"matthew","c":19,"v":5},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":2,"v":24},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Matthew repeats the words of Genesis: “a man will leave his father and mother” and be united to his wife."},{"id":"q15","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"mark","c":10,"v":7,"v2":8},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":2,"v":24},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Mark repeats “a man will leave his father and mother” from Genesis, and ends with “one flesh.”"},{"id":"q16","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"1-corinthians","c":6,"v":16},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":2,"v":24},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"1 Corinthians repeats “will become one flesh” from Genesis, and uses it to speak of a man united with a prostitute."},{"id":"q17","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"1-corinthians","c":6,"v":17},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":2,"v":24},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"1 Corinthians says one united with the Lord “is one with Him in spirit”; Genesis says a man united to his wife becomes one flesh."},{"id":"q18","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"ephesians","c":5,"v":31},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":2,"v":24},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Ephesians repeats the words of Genesis: “a man will leave his father and mother” and be united to his wife."},{"id":"q19","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"hebrews","c":6,"v":8},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":3,"v":18},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Hebrews calls land that produces “thorns and thistles” worthless; Genesis says “thorns and thistles” will be yielded to you."},{"id":"q20","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"matthew","c":19,"v":4},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":5,"v":2},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Matthew has Jesus say the Creator “made them male and female”; Genesis says “Male and female He created them.”"},{"id":"q21","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"mark","c":10,"v":6},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":5,"v":2},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Mark says God “made them male and female”; Genesis says “Male and female He created them” and that He blessed them."},{"id":"q22","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":3,"v":9},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":5,"v":2},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"James says men “have been made in God’s likeness”; Genesis says God created them male and female, blessed them, and called them “man.”"},{"id":"q23","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"hebrews","c":11,"v":5},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":5,"v":24},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Hebrews repeats “because God had taken him away” about Enoch, who in Genesis walked with God and then was no more."},{"id":"q24","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":3,"v":9},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":9,"v":6},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"James says men “have been made in God’s likeness”; Genesis says “in His own image God has made mankind.”"},{"id":"q25","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"acts","c":7,"v":3},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":12,"v":1},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Acts repeats the call “go to the land I will show you”; in Genesis, the LORD says it to Abram."},{"id":"q26","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"acts","c":3,"v":25},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":12,"v":3},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Acts repeats “all the families of the earth will be blessed”; Genesis has these words after “I will bless those who bless you.”"},{"id":"q27","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"galatians","c":3,"v":8},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":12,"v":3},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Galatians says “All nations will be blessed through you”; Genesis says “all the families of the earth will be blessed through you.”"},{"id":"q28","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"acts","c":7,"v":5},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":13,"v":15},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Acts says God promised the land to Abraham’s descendants; Genesis says “all the land that you see” goes “to you and your offspring forever.”"},{"id":"q29","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"galatians","c":3,"v":16},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":13,"v":15},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Galatians says the promises were spoken to Abraham “and to your seed,” meaning One; Genesis says the land goes “to you and your offspring forever.”"},{"id":"q30","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"hebrews","c":7,"v":1},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":14,"v":17},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Hebrews says Melchizedek met Abraham “returning from the slaughter of the kings”; Genesis tells of that return, when the king of Sodom met him."},{"id":"q31","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"romans","c":4,"v":18},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":15,"v":5},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Romans repeats “So shall your offspring be”; in Genesis, the LORD says it to Abram after telling him to count the stars."},{"id":"q32","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"romans","c":4,"v":3},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":15,"v":6},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Romans repeats “it was credited to him as righteousness” about Abraham; Genesis says Abram believed the LORD."},{"id":"q33","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"romans","c":4,"v":9},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":15,"v":6},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Romans says Abraham’s faith “was credited to him as righteousness,” the words of Genesis, where Abram believed the LORD."},{"id":"q34","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"romans","c":4,"v":22},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":15,"v":6},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Romans repeats “it was credited to him as righteousness,” which Genesis says after Abram believed the LORD."},{"id":"q35","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"galatians","c":3,"v":6},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":15,"v":6},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Galatians repeats “Abraham believed God, and it was credited to him as righteousness”; Genesis says Abram believed the LORD."},{"id":"q36","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":2,"v":23},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":15,"v":6},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"James repeats “it was credited to him as righteousness” from Genesis and adds that Abraham “was called a friend of God.”"},{"id":"q37","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"acts","c":7,"v":6},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":15,"v":13},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Acts repeats that the descendants will be “enslaved and mistreated four hundred years”; Genesis records the LORD saying this to Abram."},{"id":"q38","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"acts","c":7,"v":7},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":15,"v":14},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Acts says God will “punish the nation that enslaves them”; Genesis says the LORD will judge the nation, and afterward they will depart."},{"id":"q39","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"romans","c":4,"v":17},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":17,"v":5},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Romans repeats “I have made you a father of many nations”; Genesis gives these words with Abram’s new name, Abraham."},{"id":"q40","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"galatians","c":3,"v":16},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":17,"v":7},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Galatians stresses “and to your seed” rather than seeds; Genesis speaks of a covenant between “Me and you and your descendants after you.”"},{"id":"q41","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"acts","c":7,"v":5},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":17,"v":8},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Acts says God promised the land to Abraham and his descendants; Genesis says “all the land of Canaan” will be “an eternal possession.”"},{"id":"q42","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"romans","c":9,"v":9},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":18,"v":10},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Romans repeats the promise “Sarah will have a son”; in Genesis, the LORD says He will return at this time next year."},{"id":"q43","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"1-peter","c":3,"v":6},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":18,"v":12},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"1 Peter says Sarah “called him lord”; in Genesis she says to herself, “my master is old.”"},{"id":"q44","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"galatians","c":4,"v":30},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":21,"v":10},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Galatians repeats “Expel the slave woman and her son”; Genesis has these words spoken to Abraham, about the slave woman’s son and Isaac."},{"id":"q45","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"romans","c":9,"v":7},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":21,"v":12},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Romans repeats “Through Isaac your offspring will be reckoned”; in Genesis, God says this to Abraham."},{"id":"q46","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"hebrews","c":11,"v":18},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":21,"v":12},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Hebrews repeats what God had said to Abraham in Genesis: “Through Isaac your offspring will be reckoned.”"},{"id":"q47","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"matthew","c":3,"v":17},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":22,"v":2},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Matthew has a voice from heaven say “My beloved Son”; Genesis has God say “your only son Isaac, whom you love.”"},{"id":"q48","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"matthew","c":17,"v":5},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":22,"v":2},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Matthew has a voice from a cloud say “My beloved Son”; Genesis has God say “your only son Isaac, whom you love.”"},{"id":"q49","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"mark","c":1,"v":11},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":22,"v":2},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Mark has a voice from heaven say “You are My beloved Son”; Genesis has God say “your only son Isaac, whom you love.”"},{"id":"q50","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"mark","c":9,"v":7},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":22,"v":2},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Mark has a voice from a cloud say “This is My beloved Son”; Genesis has God say “your only son Isaac, whom you love.”"},{"id":"q51","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"luke","c":3,"v":22},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":22,"v":2},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Luke has a voice from heaven say “You are My beloved Son”; Genesis has God say “your only son Isaac, whom you love.”"},{"id":"q52","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"john","c":1,"v":14},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":22,"v":2},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"John speaks of “the one and only Son from the Father”; Genesis has God say “your only son Isaac, whom you love.”"},{"id":"q53","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"2-peter","c":1,"v":17},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":22,"v":2},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"2 Peter has a voice say “This is My beloved Son”; Genesis has God say “your only son Isaac, whom you love.”"},{"id":"q54","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":2,"v":21},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":22,"v":9},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"James says Abraham “offered his son Isaac on the altar”; Genesis tells how Abraham built the altar and placed his son Isaac on it."},{"id":"q55","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"hebrews","c":6,"v":13},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":22,"v":16},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Hebrews says God had no one greater, so He “swore by Himself”; in Genesis, the LORD says, “By Myself I have sworn.”"},{"id":"q56","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"hebrews","c":6,"v":14},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":22,"v":17},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Hebrews repeats the promise “I will surely bless you and multiply your descendants”; Genesis adds “like the stars in the sky.”"},{"id":"q57","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"hebrews","c":11,"v":12},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":22,"v":17},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Hebrews says descendants came as numerous as “the stars in the sky” and “the sand on the seashore”; Genesis has the same words."},{"id":"q58","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"acts","c":3,"v":25},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":22,"v":18},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Acts repeats the promise “Through your offspring all the families of the earth will be blessed”; Genesis says “all nations of the earth.”"},{"id":"q59","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"romans","c":9,"v":12},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":25,"v":23},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Romans repeats “The older will serve the younger”; Genesis gives these words about two nations in the womb."},{"id":"q60","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"acts","c":3,"v":25},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":26,"v":4},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Acts repeats “Through your offspring all the families of the earth will be blessed”; Genesis says “all nations of the earth will be blessed.”"},{"id":"q61","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"john","c":1,"v":51},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":28,"v":12},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"John speaks of “the angels of God ascending and descending”; Genesis tells of Jacob’s dream, where “God’s angels were going up and down.”"},{"id":"q62","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"acts","c":3,"v":25},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":28,"v":14},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Acts repeats “all the families of the earth will be blessed”; Genesis says it will be “through you and your offspring.”"},{"id":"q63","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"matthew","c":22,"v":24},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":38,"v":8},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Matthew says a brother is to “raise up offspring for him”; Genesis has Judah tell Onan to “raise up offspring for your brother.”"},{"id":"q64","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"mark","c":12,"v":19},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":38,"v":8},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason"